#
# io unit tests (WI-1.100, WI-1.101). Catch2's CHECK/REQUIRE macros expand to branches, so a test
# case trips readability-function-cognitive-complexity on code that has almost no control flow of its own.
# Count only the test's own branches.
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity.IgnoreMacros: true
